    "message": "chore(release): 0.9.2\n\nThe repo copy had drifted to 0.6.1 while releases ran to 0.9.1 — the\nrelease workflow derives the version from the git tag and rewrites this\nfile at build time, so users never saw it. It still feeds\ngetCurrentVersion(), so a source checkout reported 0.6.1 and told\ncontributors they were several versions behind.",
